      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "TITLE",
      "narration_text": "Namaste — this is Liam, in for Ameya. Thirteen thousand congressional stock trades, and the one signal inside them that is not noise.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B01",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B01.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 9.49,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B01.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B01",
        "at": "2026-08-31T12:41:04"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "Since twenty-twelve the STOCK Act forces members of Congress to disclose their trades. Run it on five thousand priced buys and the raw return is plus two point two three percent. At first glance, they can pick stocks.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B02",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B02.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 12.22,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B02.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B02",
        "at": "2026-08-31T12:41:04"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "But subtract the market. Measure each stock against S P Y over the same thirty days, and that edge nearly vanishes. On its own, Congress does not beat the market.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B03",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B03.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 9.69,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B03.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B03",
        "at": "2026-08-31T12:41:04"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "LIST",
      "narration_text": "So stop scoring trades alone and look for convergence. Flag every ticker where two or more independent members buy inside a thirty-day window.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B04",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B04.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 8.85,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B04.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B04",
        "at": "2026-08-31T12:41:04"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "Re-run, and the table splits. The clustered buys — about two thousand events — earn small but positive alpha, plus zero point two three to plus zero point five four percent.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B05",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B05.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 13.29,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B05.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B05",
        "at": "2026-08-31T12:41:04"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "STATEMENT",
      "narration_text": "And the edge lives in cluster membership — independent members converging on one ticker — not in how heavily any single member bought. Convergence, not conviction.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "manim",
        "motion": "fade",
        "manim": {
          "scene_class": "B06",
          "file": "scenes.py"
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B06.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 12.14,
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim\\B06.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim:B06",
        "at": "2026-08-31T12:41:04"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "TITLE",
      "narration_text": "Congress does not beat the market. The cluster does, barely. This is Liam, in for Ameya.",
